ations before using AI in coursework, and directly used AI output needs a formal citation.","sourceUrls":["https://uri.libguides.com/ai/citing"]},{"id":"claim:claim-uri-no-wide-coursework-policy-2025","category":"tracker_addition","theme":"source_status","claimId":"claim-uri-no-wide-coursework-policy-2025","matchMethod":"none","newText":"As of July 2025, a Provost syllabus memo stated that URI did not have a university-wide policy governing generative AI use in coursework, while offering optional AI syllabus statements for faculty.","sourceUrls":["https://web.uri.edu/provost/wp-content/uploads/sites/2152/2025-Fall-Updates-and-Syllabus-Policy-Memo-FINAL.pdf"]},{"id":"claim:claim-uri-student-instructor-ai-policies","category":"tracker_addition","theme":"academic_integrity","claimId":"claim-uri-student-instructor-ai-policies","matchMethod":"none","newText":"URI ITS tells students to follow instructors' AI policies, attribute AI-generated content, and avoid AI use that breaches URI's Student Code of Conduct.","sourceUrls":["https://its.uri.edu/ai-at-uri/"]},{"id":"claim:claim-uri-supported-ai-tools","category":"tracker_addition","theme":"ai_tool_treatment","claimId":"claim-uri-supported-ai-tools","matchMethod":"none","newText":"URI ITS points users to URI-supported AI tools such as LibreChat and Microsoft Copilot, and its Generative AI service page says role-based service search displays AI-related tools vetted for use at URI.","sourceUrls":["https://its.uri.edu/generative-ai/","https://its.uri.edu/using-ai-at-uri/"]},{"id":"source_added:https://its.uri.edu/ai-at-uri/","category":"source_update","theme":"sources","matchMethod":"source_claim_type","sourceUrls":["https://its.uri.edu/ai-at-uri/"]},{"id":"source_added:https://its.uri.edu/generative-ai/","category":"source_update","theme":"sources","matchMethod":"source_claim_type","sourceUrls":["https://its.uri.edu/generative-ai/"]},{"id":"source_added:https://its.uri.edu/using-ai-at-uri/","category":"source_update","theme"